vBot 4.8 CLI support — production code changes
Reproduction record for a different machine. Covers production code only
(`main.lua`, `shim/.lua`). Test files are listed at the end for reference but their
contents are not reproduced here.
Repository root used here: `/home/sabre/otclua/otclua`
Runtime: LuaJIT 2.1 (on this machine `luajittex --luaonly <file>`)
Upstream reference inspected online only, never cloned or copied:
`Vithrax/vBot@09d6816c817f881735ecf78e87e052fcf7c02816` (its `vBot/main.lua`
declares `local version = "4.8"`)
Scope decision that drives every change
The target is headless CLI automation: CaveBot, AttackBot, HealBot, TargetBot,
looting and their supporting functions. Explicitly out of scope: physical
keyboard/mouse input, alarms, sound, window flashing, HTTP version checks, and the
optional BotServer relay. Nothing below adds those; several changes exist purely so
their absence cannot break startup of a stock profile.
